{
  "_comment": "G19 (CLAUDE.md, 1 Oct 2026): nothing public may reveal how Bricks of India works. ONE term list used by the CI public-text check (scripts/ci/g19-check.mjs), the article lint gate (src/lib/g19.ts -> src/lib/lint.ts), and the video/caption quality gates (Python). Patterns are case-insensitive regex, written to work in both JavaScript and Python. Narrow on purpose so ordinary LEGO writing (a Technic 'automatic gearbox', 'feed a family') isn't rejected.",
